# Anthropological Mission {2}{U}: Enchantment
#   Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a quest counter on this enchantment. Draw a card. Then discard a card unless this enchantment has three or more quest counters on it.
# Bot1 casts its whole opening hand, so its hand is empty as each trigger resolves. The first two Zuran Orbs give the
# Mission one and two quest counters: Bot1 draws an Island and then discards it (a discard first would find the hand
# empty and keep the Island). The third Orb's trigger gives it its third counter, exactly at "three or more", so Bot1
# keeps the Memnite it draws. Memnite is a creature spell and triggers nothing (CR 603.2): the Mission stays at three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Anthropological Mission
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Zuran Orb
Zuran Orb
Zuran Orb
Island
Island
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Anthropological Mission.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Zuran Orb.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Hand.Zuran Orb.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Hand.Zuran Orb.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand = Memnite
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Anthropological Mission.Counters.Quest = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Anthropological Mission; Zuran Orb; Zuran Orb; Zuran Orb; Memnite
Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Island
